From 5ed8417d8e1a75f423e13feff43eb714c10ebbfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xtu-v41 <xtu@local>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 23:29:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/16] feat(DSv4.1/SM80): portable Triton sparse-MLA decode so
 V4.1 attention runs on A100

Completes the SM80 attention path: `_forward_decode` called `flash_mla_with_kvcache`,
which is a raise-stub on non-SM90 exactly like the prefill op.

- `_forward_sparse_mla_swa_decode_triton` (compress_ratio == 0 / SWA-only):
  non-MTP -> `fp8ds_paged_sparse_mla_attention_with_sink_multihead`;
  MTP -> online-softmax accumulate over `decode_swa_indices` + sink finish.
- `_forward_sparse_mla_compressed_decode_triton` (compress_ratio in {1,2}):
  non-MTP -> `fp8ds_global_paged_sparse_mla_attention_with_sink_multihead`
  (compressed physical slots + SWA window; the kernel is ratio-agnostic, so c1a
  and c2a share it); MTP -> chunked compressed accumulate + SWA accumulate merged
  into ONE online-softmax state (mathematically identical to V4's two-state
  merge, and halves the reserved workspace).
- Warmup spec reserves 3 float32 decode state buffers, gated on
  `is_triton_sparse_mla_enabled(q.device)`.

Gate: only `is_triton_sparse_mla_enabled(q.device)` (Ampere/Ada) takes the new
path; the SM90+ `tile_metadata` + `flash_mla_with_kvcache` statements are
unchanged in content and order.

NO COMPATIBILITY IMPACT ON OTHER MODELS (project principle): every file this
V4.1 work touches lives under `vllm/models/deepseek_v41/` -- a package no other
model imports. `git diff 34e36f8075 HEAD --name-only` + `git diff --name-only`
contain no file outside that directory, so V4/Qwen/GLM/Mixtral paths are
untouched and their measured performance is unaffected by construction.

Verified on GPU 2 (A100, SM80) vs a float32 torch reference over synthetic
fp8_ds_mla paged caches, 3 identical runs, 7 cases (SWA-only / compressed x
non-MTP / MTP): worst max_abs=3.69e-3, max_rel=2.73e-2 (bf16 output rounding);
padded heads verified zeroed. Prefill test re-run: still passes.

(cherry picked from commit 4306f50156d027a1cdc4914a57c81c4fb2321890)
